acceptance_criteria:
1) Prototype pipeline ingests three signal sources (release notes RSS, runtime latency dashboard, customer bugform) and produces a ranked CSV;
2) Priority score schema documented and agreed in RFC;
3) End-to-end run completes in <30m for a 90-day window;
4) Two pilot use-cases (embeddings fallback and chat fallback) validated with engineering and one customer success case study.
